                  "description": {
                    "value": "The target's skin becomes tough, with a consistency like bark or wood. The target gains resistance 2 to bludgeoning and piercing damage and weakness 3 to fire. After the target takes fire damage, it can dismiss the spell as a free action triggered by taking the damage; doing so doesn't reduce the fire damage the target was dealt."
